          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## FOM roll-to-roll coater: Equipment-specific dashboard\n\nThis dashboard plots measurement and control channels selected for the FOM roll-to-roll coater. These panels represent functionality configured specifically for the FOM equipment wrapper.\n\n\nThis dashboard plots **11 channel(s)** grouped under **7 semantic property/properties**.\n\nEach time-series panel represents one semantic property. Signals that use the same semantic property and physical unit are displayed together so that related equipment values can be compared.\n\nThe data is read from the equipment time-series tables. Each table contains a `time` column and a `value` column.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
